i18_-Fw9KWAxXqa_UHHfUkOnMQ3YcHCLgBKAA"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwi18_-Fw9KWAxXqa_UHHfUkOnMQ3IcHCLcBKB0",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["📍日向洋食 Hinata\n\n這次點了招牌的紅酒燉牛肉咖哩歐姆蛋飯、洋風炸雞、多蜜醬純牛漢堡排，每一道都很有日本洋食店的經典風味。\n\n最推薦限定的紅酒燉牛肉咖哩歐姆蛋飯，滑嫩半熟歐姆蛋搭配濃郁咖哩與燉到入口即化的牛肉，香氣讓整體層次更加豐富，吃起來溫暖又療癒。\n\n多蜜醬純牛漢堡排也相當出色，牛肉香氣濃郁、肉汁飽滿，搭配主廚自製多蜜醬，濃厚卻不膩口。\n\n洋風炸雞外酥內嫩、肉汁充足，配上塔塔醬更加提味；另外奶油菠菜香濃滑順。\n\nAlvin給星｜⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️\n整體餐點水準穩定、份量充足，充滿昭和洋食店的溫暖氛圍。\n\n2026.05初訪",null,[0,64]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17270342454048563654/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPV1ZwcVJrMWhSVXBIVldwR1UyVkZjRmhPU0ZJMlZVVndiVlpWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17270342454048563654/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPV1ZwcVJrMWhSVXBIVldwR1UyVkZjRmhPU0ZJMlZVVndiVlpWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17270342454048563654/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPV1ZwcVJrMWhSVXBIVldwR1UyVkZjRmhPU0ZJMlZVVndiVlpWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17270342454048563654/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPV1ZwcVJrMWhSVXBIVldwR1UyVkZjRmhPU0ZJMlZVVndiVlpWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17270342454048563654/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPV1ZwcVJrMWhSVXBIVldwR1UyVkZjRmhPU0ZJMlZVVndiVlpWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17270342454048563654/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPV1ZwcVJrMWhSVXBIVldwR1UyVkZjRmhPU0ZJMlZVVndiVlpWUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,2931,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOWVpqRk1hRUpHVWpGU2VFcFhOSFI2VUVwbVZVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xd1072943570fe67!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlNYZjFMaEJGUjFSeEpXNHR6UEpmVUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQ